    "text": "<p>At <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of iron reacts with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>HCl</mi></math> to form <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCl</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>. The evolved hydrogen gas expands against a constant pressure of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>bar</mi></math>. The work done by the gas during this expansion is -_______ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>.</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest Integer)</p><p>[Given : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>314</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. Assume, hydrogen is an ideal gas]</p><p>[Atomic mass off Fe is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>55</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>85</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>]</p>"
